  "body": "- Where Nature Meets the Water -\r\n\r\nImagine waking to a chorus of native birdsong, completely hidden from the hustle and bustle, yet knowing everything you need is just moments away.\r\n\r\nThis exceptional 1,234 sqm (more or less) section offers a rare opportunity to design and build a bespoke dream home in a truly unmatched coastal setting.\r\n\r\nThis expansive, sun-drenched site is enveloped by mature native trees, creating a beautifully secluded, private sanctuary.\r\n\r\nThe property is positioned to capture sweeping, picturesque views of the Weiti River, offering a stunning, ever-changing backdrop of water, sky, and passing boats.\r\n\r\nTucked away at the end of a quiet, family-friendly cul-de-sac, ensuring total privacy, safety, and exclusivity.\r\n\r\nOpportunities to secure a landholding of this size, beauty, and position are incredibly rare. Bring your architect, ignite your imagination, and start planning your ultimate escape today.\r\n\r\nContact us now to secure your property information pack or arrange a private viewing.",
